OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1970, Washoe the chimp was
OL,17,     Frecognised as the first non-human
OL,18,     Fto learn a human language. She was
OL,19,     Ftaught American sign language in a
OL,20,     Frevolutionary and controversial
OL,21,     Fexperiment.
